# Server-only source template. Do NOT put a real key here and do NOT copy this into a client config.
# Initialize-CohesitySharedKey.ps1 reads COHESITY_API_KEY from this file and writes the
# protected record to:
#   C:\caddy-gateway\secrets\cohesity-gateway.xml
# The bridge loads that DPAPI-protected record through a restricted local helper.
COHESITY_API_KEY=
